It should pretty print SQL inside sql tags
{% sql %}
  SELECT
    [NickName],
    [LastName]
  FROM
    [Person]
  WHERE
    [LastName] = 'Decker'
{% endsql %}

It should keep the sql command arguments
{% sql return:'mylist' %}
  SELECT
    [NickName],
    [LastName]
  FROM
    [Person]
  WHERE
    [LastName] = 'Decker'
{% endsql %}

It should fallback to reindenting when the sql contains Lava
{% sql %}
  SELECT [NickName] FROM [Person] WHERE [LastName] = '{{ lastName }}'
{% endsql %}
